  "details": "Currently, at least with the udon graph, public variables can only be sorted from oldest to newest. But I would find it very useful to be able to sort them any way I want. Maybe you could drag and drop them in within the variables list, or maybe you can have a specific button to sort by type. Any way it’s implemented, I would love a feature to sort public variables instead of having to create them in the order I want them to appear.",
